khyaśivacaṃdrausamālikhet <2>anusāravisargā
bhyāṃmaṃtritaukramataḥpriye saṃjīvanicajūṃjī
vaṃprāṇagraṃthisyamālikhet <3>kuruśabdaṃbhṛguḥ
sargīvaktijāyānvitomanuḥ viṃśatyarṇṛṣiḥ
śukrogāyatraṃchaṃducyate saṃjīvanīdevatāsyā
cchaktiraṃtyādivījakam tṛtīyaṃcacatuṣkaṃca
dvitīyaṃpaṃcakaṃtathā caturddhikaṃcakramataḥṣa
ḍaṃgānipravinyaset bhūrjekṣīreṇavilikhe
tṣaṭkoṇemaṃḍalaṃsudhīḥ karpūrābhāṃhāra
