lāṃcadadhatīṃciṃtayetparāṃ evaṃdhyātvāvāhyama

<daṃ0saṃ0 pṛ0 16a> dhyepūjayedupacārakaiḥ ādāvaṃgānisaṃpūjya
ṣaṭkoṇeṣucapūjayet saṃjīvanītathābu
