vasaṃtaṃmadanaṃcaṃdraṃvidyābhāgatrayeṇatu triko

<da0sa0 pṛ0 17a> ṇepūjayenmaṃtrīprādakṣiṇyenacāgrataḥ brahma
viśvīśaśavdāṃteyajetsaṃjīvinītrayam iti
saṃjīvinīṣaṭkaṃtrikoṇepūjayetsudhīḥ <12>
