tīṃpūjyātripureśīcanānyathā <25>[itidakṣiṇāmū
rtisaṃhitāyāṃbhairavīvarṇanaṃnāmacaturdaśaḥpaṭalaḥ] 
<14> īśvaruvāca atheśānenavaktreṇamapāyāpipra
japyate vidyānāṃpaṃcakaṃdevitriṣulokeṣudurlabhāṃ <1>
