<daṃ0saṃ0 pṛ0 58a> saṃpūjyamadhyekramataḥmātṛkātmakamācaret paṃca
kośamahāvidyāṃsaṃsmarettatrasuṃdari <14>tārtī
yaṃśrīgurorvījaṃhaṃsavidyāmanuṃjapet vāratra
yaṃcadeveśiśrīvidyāṃsaptadhāyajet <15>spṛ
ṣṭvārghyakaṃtatogaṃdhapuṣpādyairarcayettataḥ cidā
