vrahmaraṃdhrekṣipeddevimaṇivaṃdhenyasettataḥ <37>
lalāṭenāmikāṃkuryātṣoḍaśārṇāṃsmaretpriye 
trailokyamaruṇaṃdhyāyennyāsasaṃmohanābhidhaḥ 
