ādhārevyūhakaṃyāvadrahasyāyoginīrnyaset sṛ

<pṛ0 59ba> ṣṭinyāsaṃtataḥkuryātsarvasiddhiḥpradāyakaṃ <44>
brahmaraṃdhrelikenetreśrutighrāṇoṣṭakeṣuca o
ṣṭayordaṃtayordevijihvāyāṃcorakūpake <45>
