kānanākṣiśrutighrāṇagaṃḍoṣṭeṣumukhāṃtare ne
trayorvadanevarṇānnyasetsaubhāgyahetave <47>ka
sīmaṃtalalāṭeṣubhrūyugeghrāṇavaktrayoḥ kara
